// THE framework registry (build-brief §4.1, SAD §2.4, ADR-2). The UI renders
// framework lists, labels and colours purely from here. No `if (framework === …)`
// branching anywhere in components — add a framework by adding a registry entry +
// data, never by editing component logic.
//
// MITRE ATT&CK is the foundational threat taxonomy: every control / countermeasure
// / risk / vulnerability framework maps AGAINST its technique entities.
//
// `populated: false` marks frameworks registered for the rebuild but without source
// data in the repo yet (scaffold decision — build-brief §6, ADR-7: never invent
